<title>ITALY: Italy December wholesale prices rose 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy December wholesale prices rose 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for December.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p> Year/Year change	+1.4 pct     +1.7 pct  +10.1% pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change     0.0 pct     -0.2 pct   +0.3% pct</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)    134.4	 134.4     132.6</p>
<p>Note: Istat said wholesale prices rose 3.6 pct in 1996 after a rise of 10.3 pct in 1995</p>
</text>
